┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  mecatui — keys & features                                                                                                                                 ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  Prompting                                                                                                                                                 ┃
┃    enter         send the prompt                                                                                                                           ┃
┃    shift+enter   newline (also ctrl+j)                                                                                                                     ┃
┃    /             slash-command palette (built-ins always; workspace commands when enabled)                                                                 ┃
┃    @             attach a file: image/audio inlines as media (when supported), else inlines text                                                           ┃
┃    ctrl+v        paste a clipboard image as an attachment (when supported), else paste text                                                                ┃
┃    esc           cancel the running turn                                                                                                                   ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  While a run is streaming                                                                                                                                  ┃
┃    enter         queue a follow-up (sends when the turn ends)                                                                                              ┃
┃    esc           clear staged input / queue, else cancel run                                                                                               ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  Inspect & control                                                                                                                                         ┃
┃    ctrl+o        MCP inventory                                                                                                                             ┃
┃    ctrl+r        MCP resources                                                                                                                             ┃
┃    ctrl+p        MCP prompts                                                                                                                               ┃
┃    ctrl+a        agents overlay (subagents / parallel / teams · tab to switch)                                                                             ┃
┃    alt+m         cycle permission mode (default / plan / accept-edits)                                                                                     ┃
┃    ctrl+t        expand/collapse details                                                                                                                   ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  General                                                                                                                                                   ┃
┃    pgup/pgdn     scroll the conversation (a ↑NN% header cue shows while scrolled up)                                                                       ┃
┃    home/end      jump to top / bottom (end resumes auto-follow)                                                                                            ┃
┃    wheel         mouse-wheel scroll (alt screen only)                                                                                                      ┃
┃    drag          select text · drag to an edge auto-scrolls · copies on release · double-click word · triple-click line · right-click copies · esc clears  ┃
┃    middle-click  paste the primary selection into the prompt (X11/Wayland; shift+middle-click pastes via the terminal instead)                             ┃
┃    ?             this help (on an empty prompt)                                                                                                            ┃
┃    ctrl+c        quit (press twice; first press clears the prompt or arms, again within 3s exits)                                                          ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  Skills activate automatically when the model needs them; type /skills                                                                                     ┃
┃  to browse the skills inventory.                                                                                                                           ┃
┃  Type / to browse slash commands.                                                                                                                          ┃
┃  Cross-session memory is on — context carries across runs.                                                                                                 ┃
┃  Type @ to attach a file — this model takes text only, so files inline as text.                                                                            ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  ↑ input · ↓ output · ⊕ cache write                                                                                                                        ┃
┃  cache N% — share of input tokens served from cache                                                                                                        ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃  esc or ? to close                                                                                                                                         ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                            ┃
